   "source": [
    "## LINE STYLE"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "7c497dd0-839d-4aa0-bfa0-6a290f80380b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Line style controls how the line is drawn.\n",
    "\n",
    "solid   → ─────────\n",
    "dashed  → - - - - -\n",
    "dotted  → · · · · · (:) use this (:) ... This one is not supported\n",
    "dash-dot → -·-·-·-\n",
    "\n",
    "syntax = ax.plot(x, y, linestyle=\"--\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 127,
   "id": "6546599f-7575-46a3-b8f0-7dd620734be4",
